window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Carolina Hayes isn’t just another barista behind the counter at Caffè Inferno—she’s an undercover agent on a mission to dismantle a criminal empire steeped in smuggling, secrets, and scorched loyalties. Her target: Marco Moretti, the enigmatic café owner whose imported beans mask something far more dangerous than caffeine.</p> <p>But when the line between assignment and obsession blurs, Carolina finds herself entangled in a world where every espresso shot could be a warning—and every glance from Marco, a trap.</p> <p>As the heat rises and betrayals boil over, she must choose between duty and desire, vengeance and survival. Because in this café, no one is who they seem. And some blends are brewed for revenge.</p>"; 
